#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SE2252 expect=violation domain=TT
#note "Second in-scope domain: TT carries RSTGCD as its topic variable; the 9-character value on row 1 fires."
#library standard=sendig-dart version=1-1
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 RSTGCD=LACTPERIX
dataset TT label="Trial Repro Stages"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col RSTGCD  type=Char label="Repro Stage Code"
col RSTG    type=Char label="Repro Stage"
---
S1 | TT | LACTPERIX | Lactation period
S1 | TT | LACTPERI | Lactation period
